              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïwuwö chane Sinay kutïng pö ECHOTYON akïpa rutogh nyo pö osis sömök. Akimi osis lapay Santuku Muma* kuntöghoghchini chane atökïyörchï wölo möngöy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
