              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kikïsït Santuku Muma, kïlö Musa, “Ngeta ECHOTYON aitoyö punköku aikany kïryöghö tawungu chona reyinyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
